ture signatures, arm64+x86_64 membership, empty entitlements parsed with `plutil`, tracking-false privacy, empty xattrs and no symlinks. Mounted content finds923virtualfiles/47generatedworldfiles/38chunks and zero private paths/raw data/banned content. Compared with the historical candidate's929files, the six absent entries are only `.gdc`/`.gd.remap` pairs for three candidate-only 1444 validation helpers; all packed paths were compared, with no additions. World/resource identities and privacy scope remain exact.\n\nThe external fixture changes only current authority hashes/counts/versions; target geometry and dispatch helpers remain exact. Current11/213 is distinct from historical candidate-package10/213 and captured adapter9/213 credit0 metadata. Frozen visual, source and mechanics decisions are reused with their original limits, including the combined raw mechanics FAIL/reconciliation and historical AVI sampling/container disclosure. This release creates no new art image, motion/route judgment or recognition credit. Ordinary launch and publication still need their actual outcomes.\n\n[Raw review]({TASK_ROOT}/work/1444-exact-current-release-independent-001/PACKAGE_REVIEW.json) SHA `1947b0bff575d0c0b27f996e6db11af333d851682b2b4a6d9756436ae545a02c`; [single final preservation and PID check]({TASK_ROOT}/work/1444-exact-current-release-independent-001/final-post-execution.json) SHA `2c8c10b6181316196c15f99b70f96026b16d9b6c8452cabbc94eea7e3a08146c`; [static review]({TASK_ROOT}/work/1444-exact-current-release-independent-001/STATIC_REVIEW.md) SHA `8bb0b84ac85088d84cc5b07539e979f35562985c0eaa742d1540c74d08bad2ab`; [owner handoff binding]({TASK_ROOT}/work/1444-exact-current-release-independent-001/OWNER_HANDOFF_BINDING.json) SHA `12d35cf5752c23192dc683413215706781ac17e815cbd853dddbbfe85c357d8c`. No concrete release-review gap remains.\n\nNormal RETRO for serialized author append:\n\nreview_1439_package — independent exact-current 1444 release: PASS after reusing the accep